# F Ethical Guideline in Annotation

Before annotation started, we conducted a round of training for annotators. We train annotators to strictly abide ethical guideline and removed text that violate it, which include:

- Avoid harm to others.   
- Be honest and trustworthy.   
- Be fair and take action not to discriminate.   
- Respect privacy.   
- Honor confidentiality.
